                <pb facs="1366" n="1208" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1208"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister
                    Pearson</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-01-08"><hi rendition="#italic">January 8,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Root approves Mr. Pearson’s refusal to initiate direct negotiations with the
                    Kurd accomplices, as reported in his telegram of the 8th.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
